  (text "Input: WAGO J1 from a PDH/PDP breaker slot (10-20 A).  Q3 = low-side reverse-polarity FET, D1 = 16 V TVS." (at 20 32 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5133eb21-d176-4417-8825-1b586a0dacff))
  (text "Buck leg uses external FETs Q1/Q2; boost leg FETs are inside U1." (at 160 32 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e1ba1078-d2d7-4a3e-ac90-a325bf431b8e))
  (text "UVLO rising = 1.23 V x (1 + R3/R4) = 5.9 V    FSW: R5 49.9k = 400 kHz    ILIM: R9 26.7k ~ 12.4 A    MODE: R8 0R = internal LDO, forced PWM" (at 60 105 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c9d38b1b-2556-4bc5-9423-0439d5ac4960))
